    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You can recover from social blunders and cultural misinterpretations so quickly, as if they never happened. When you fail a Culture check to recall information, or a Diplomacy check to change attitude or gather information, you can cast this spell to reroll the failed check. You can’t cast this spell again until you take a 10-minute rest to recover Stamina Points.</p>"
